# Project Conventions

- **Backend / pages**: Use PHP for the main entry and server-side logic. Prefer `.php` files (e.g. `index.php`) for pages that need backend processing.
- **Styles**: All CSS must be defined in `style.css`. Do not use inline styles or `<style>` blocks in markup.
- **Scripts**: All JavaScript must be in `scripts.js`. Do not use inline scripts or `<script>` blocks with code in HTML/PHP; only reference `scripts.js` via a `<script src="scripts.js">` tag.
